    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short 3D action RPG where you play as a young girl venturing deep into a mysterious forest, battling cursed animals along the way. Through each encounter, she gradually confronts her own inner emotions. Immerse yourself in a quiet tale of escape and renewal, brought to life with dreamy visuals and a gentle soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbA Fantastical World Inhabited by Spirits</strong><br>Explore a mystical wilderness where spirits dwell and cursed animals roam. As the player, you'll journey through these enchanted lands, uncovering the story while facing off against corrupted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbPlay as a Sword-Wielding Girl and Banish the Curse</strong><br>Take control of a brave girl who uses sword techniques to fight off the cursed beasts. Combat is central to the gameplay, and each encounter pushes you deeper into the forest\u2014and into the girl's own heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbA Compact, Repayable Experience</strong><br>Designed for short play sessions, the game features frequent, fast-paced battles to keep things engaging. The challenge level is slightly high, but players can retry as many times as needed\u2014offering a rewarding sense of growth and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 20\u201330 minutes per playthrough<br><strong>Save Feature:</strong> Not available (short-form experience)<br><strong>Supported Controllers:</strong> Nintendo Switch Pro Controller / PlayStation 5 Dual Sense (recommended)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639450/extras/d461990d3b0b39cf185d6faf3c357b87.avif?t=1753241495\" width=744 height=510 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short 3D action RPG where you play as a young girl venturing deep into a mysterious forest, battling cursed animals along the way. Through each encounter, she gradually confronts her own inner emotions. Immerse yourself in a quiet tale of escape and renewal, brought to life with dreamy visuals and a gentle soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbA Fantastical World Inhabited by Spirits</strong><br>Explore a mystical wilderness where spirits dwell and cursed animals roam. As the player, you'll journey through these enchanted lands, uncovering the story while facing off against corrupted creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbPlay as a Sword-Wielding Girl and Banish the Curse</strong><br>Take control of a brave girl who uses sword techniques to fight off the cursed beasts. Combat is central to the gameplay, and each encounter pushes you deeper into the forest\u2014and into the girl's own heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbA Compact, Repayable Experience</strong><br>Designed for short play sessions, the game features frequent, fast-paced battles to keep things engaging. The challenge level is slightly high, but players can retry as many times as needed\u2014offering a rewarding sense of growth and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong> 20\u201330 minutes per playthrough<br><strong>Save Feature:</strong> Not available (short-form experience)<br><strong>Supported Controllers:</strong> Nintendo Switch Pro Controller / PlayStation 5 Dual Sense (recommended)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639450/extras/d461990d3b0b39cf185d6faf3c357b87.avif?t=1753241495\" width=744 height=510 /></span></p>",
